      "display_name": "Ethan Mollick",
      "text": "If you haven’t made sure to turn on two-factor authentication on all accounts, have passwords with family in case you get voice calls asking for money, etc, now would be a good time.\n\nAI gains mean the costs of mass targeting individuals with very sophisticated attacks are dropping.",
